# API Rules

## Structure
- Routes → middleware (auth, validate) → handlers → services
- Import validation from `@threadsphere/shared` — single source of truth
- Return `{ error: string, details?: ZodIssue[] }` on 400 validation failures

## Validation Pattern
```typescript
import { createThreadSchema } from "@threadsphere/shared";

const parsed = createThreadSchema.safeParse(req.body);
if (!parsed.success) {
  return res.status(400).json({ error: "Validation failed", details: parsed.error.issues });
}
```

## Socket.io
- Emit to rooms, never broadcast sensitive user data globally
- Persist notifications in DB first, then emit via socket
- Event names from `SOCKET_EVENTS` in `@threadsphere/shared`

## Security
- Rate limit write endpoints (Redis)
- Helmet + CORS with explicit `CLIENT_ORIGIN`
- Sanitize HTML before persist (Phase 2)
